<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Limited cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Limited cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hilliard Lyons analyst Jeffrey Thomison said Monday it cut his rating on Limited Inc to hold from buy due to disappointing results from several women's apparel businesses.</p>
<p>-- Thomison said he also lowered his fiscal 1996 earnings estimate to $1.15 a share from $1.20 and his fiscal 1997 estimate to $1.30 a share from $1.40.</p>
<p>-- The analyst said he recommends holding Limited shares for the long term.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
